{'symbol': 'RJF', 'date': '2021-10-01 12:08:00', 'title': "STEWARD PARTNERS GLOBAL ADVISORY WELCOMES O'HARE WEALTH MANAGEMENT, A $420 MILLION TEAM IN WISCONSIN", 'text': "WASHINGTON, OCT. 1, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0STEWARD PARTNERS GLOBAL ADVISORY, LLC, AN EMPLOYEE-OWNED, FULL-SERVICE INDEPENDENT PARTNERSHIP ASSOCIATED WITH RAYMOND JAMES FINANCIAL SERVICES, INC. (MEMBER FINRA/SIPC), HAS EXPANDED ITS NETWORK WITH THE ADDITION OF O'HARE WEALTH MANAGEMENT AFFILIATED WITH STEWARD PARTNERS IN MEQUON, WISCONSIN. THE TEAM, WHICH IS STEWARD'S FIRST TEAM IN THE STATE, HAS $420 MILLION IN ASSETS UNDER MANAGEMENT."}